"\n"
"Invoice report grouped by picking\n"
"=================================\n"
"\n"
"This module modifies the standard invoice report by grouping the\n"
"invoice lines according to the pickings (delivery orders) they come\n"
"from.\n"
"\n"
"If the invoice has sections or notes the addon considers that the user\n"
"is taking care of the grouping manually and does nothing.\n"
"\n"
"Additionally, the addons sale_invoice_group_method which allows to generate\n"
"invoices grouping orders in different ways and invoice_report_picking_grouping\n"
"which generates invoice forms grouped by delivery note are not compatible.\n"
"\n"
"If sale_invoice_group_method is installed and uninstalled, its dependency\n"
"sale_order_action_invoice_create_hook must also be uninstalled.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
