"this discount. The field discount will have now the total discount to apply to the line, \n"
"including a total of 3 line discounts.\n"
"\n"
"The line discount are related with new pricelist discounts that will be shown when the price is fixed \n"
"or by a formula in sale, or with a new formula in purchase.\n"
"\n"
"The discount will be calculated in cascade with the formula:\n"
"\n"
"discount = 1-((1-discount1_partner)*(1-discount2_partner)*(1-discount_1)*(1-discount_2)*(1-discount_3))\n"
"\n"
"The reason is to avoid change Odoo standar behaviour.\n"
"\n"
"The price in invoices will be calculated using product or partner pricelist.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"* Imanol Aranburu <iaranburu@binovo.es>\n"
"* Guillermo Murcia <gmurcia@binovo.es>\n"
"* Jesús Sánchez <jsanchez@binovo.es>\n"
"\n"
"Maintainer\n"
"----------\n"
"\n"
".. image:: /account_cascade_discount/static/src/img/binovo_logo_peque.jpg\n"
