"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"Partner company sector\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"Partner company sector characterization.\n"
"\n"
"Computes if the partner's sector (public/private) and company type based on their VAT number.\n"
"\n"
"For companies, checks the VAT prefix against the VAT_PREFIX_MAPPINGS dictionary to determine the sector and company type.\n"
"\n"
"A private company could be -> foundation, company or other.\n"
"\n"
"A public company could be -> local_entity, public_entity or autonomous_entity.\n"
"\n"
"It also adds these fields to invoices, they are related to invoice's partner and user can filter and group invoices with these fields.\n"
"\n"
"VAT_PREFIX_MAPPINGS =\n"
"{\n"
"    \"ESA\": {\"private\": \"company\", \"public\": False, \"foreigner\": False},\n"
"\n"
"    \"ESB\": {\"private\": \"company\", \"public\": False, \"foreigner\": False},\n"
"\n"
"    \"ESC\": {\"private\": \"company\", \"public\": False, \"foreigner\": False},\n"
"\n"
