"\n"
"Product internal reference configurator\n"
"=======================================\n"
"\n"
"Product variants internal reference configurator.\n"
"\n"
"Generate internal references for variants automatically when creating the templates. Internal references are computed depending of a string base defined in the product template and string prefixes and suffixes defined at product attribute and values.\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"-------------\n"
"\n"
"* Create a template, fill the \"Internal reference base\" field with a base string for variants internal references.\n"
"\n"
"* Associate the template with attribute value lines.\n"
"\n"
"* Go to a attribute and fill the fields to prefix or suffix the base string defined at the template and also a string separator, then fill the \"Variant reference value\" in each value line.\n"
"\n"
"* The order of the different attribute values in the internal reference string is defined by the sequence.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
