msgid ""
".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.svg\n"
"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"Room booking\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"Room booking management.\n"
"\n"
"Groups:\n"
"\n"
"* User: a user can read all room booking data and has all crud access to room bookings.\n"
"* Responsible: a responsible can do all operations on all room booking models.\n"
"\n"
"Models:\n"
"\n"
"* Room: it is a model that defines characteristics of a room.\n"
"\n"
"* Room category: it is a model that defines characteristics of a room category e.g single, double.\n"
"\n"
"* Floor: it is a model that defines a floor for a room.\n"
"\n"
"* Room amenity: it is a model that defines amenities for a room.\n"
"\n"
"* Room amenity category: it is a model that defines characteristics of an amenity category e.g Media & Technology, Food & Drink.\n"
"\n"
"* Booking: it is a model that defines characteristics of a booking: rooms, check in & out days, associated partner and so on.\n"
"\n"
"Workflow:\n"
"\n"
"* Create your own configuration of rooms, categories, floors and amenities.\n"
"\n"
"* You can start managing room bookings of customers.\n"
"\n"
"Dependencies\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"This addon depends on web_timeline for the timeline view of room booking management.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"* Ugaitz Olaizola <uolaizola@binovo.es>\n"
"\n"
"Maintainer\n"
"----------\n"
"\n"
".. image:: /room_booking/static/src/img/binovo.png\n"
"   :alt: Binovo IT Human Project SL\n"
"   :target: http://www.binovo.es\n"
"\n"
"This module is maintained by Binovo IT Human Project SL.\n"
msgstr ""

