#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_order_external_values
msgid ""
".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.svg\n"
"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"Sale Order External Values\n"
"==========================\n"
"\n"
"This addon redefines sale order and sale order line create methods in order to use object dictionaries instead of integer id identifiers for the next fields.\n"
"\n"
"Sale order\n"
"----------\n"
"\n"
"* partner_id, partner_invoice_id, partner_shipping_id: use a dictionary object with required partner values, in case that 'email' is in the dictionary and a res.partner exists with this email (addon res_partner_external_email must be installed), then the partner is not created; however, if a partner is not found with this 'email'. Finally if a partner is not found in the system with the 'email', then the partner is created with given values before the sale.order is created.\n"
"\n"
"Sale order line\n"
"---------------\n"
"\n"
"* product_id: use a dictionary with 'default_code' to identify a product instead of a integer with the id, if a product is found with this default_code then the sale.order.line is created; otherwise, a validation error is raised, the product with this default_code must exist. Also is possible identify the product by id {\"product_id\": 3}.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"* Ugaitz Olaizola <uolaizola@binovo.es>\n"
"* Jesús Sánchez <jsanchez@binovo.es>\n"
"\n"
"Maintainer\n"
"----------\n"
"\n"
