msgid ""
".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.svg\n"
"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"Seaport management\n"
"==================\n"
"\n"
"Management of seaports, watercraft, moorings and mooring bookings.\n"
"\n"
"Groups:\n"
"\n"
"* User: a user can read all seaport data and has all CRUD permission for certain models, but does not have access to configuration data.\n"
"* Responsible: a responsible can do all operations on all seaport models.\n"
"\n"
"Mayor models:\n"
"\n"
"* Seaport: it is a model that defines characteristics of a seaport.\n"
"* Mooring: it is a model that defines characteristics of moorings of seaports.\n"
"* Watercraft: it is a model that defines characteristics of watercraft.\n"
"* Watercraft crew member.\n"
"* Mooring booking: a booking for a mooring, a relationship between a watercraft, a mooring for certain dates.\n"
"\n"
"Workflow:\n"
"\n"
"* Create your own configuration of seaports, moorings, watercraft and then you can manage bookings.\n"
"\n"
"Dependencies\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"tracking_manager: to track relational fields.\n"
"lean_dms: documentation for seaports and watecraft.\n"
"web_timeline: timeline view for mooring bookings.\n"
"partner_contact_birthdate.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"* Ugaitz Olaizola <uolaizola@binovo.es>\n"
"\n"
"Maintainer\n"
"----------\n"
"\n"
