".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-OCA%2Faccount--fiscal--rule-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/OCA/account-fiscal-rule/tree/16.0/l10n_eu_oss_oca\n"
