"    :target: https://github.com/carlosdauden\n"
"    :alt: carlosdauden\n"
"\n"
"Current `maintainer <https://odoo-community.org/page/maintainer-role>`__:\n"
"\n"
"|maintainer-carlosdauden| \n"
"\n"
