"* initOS GmbH & Co.\n"
"* \n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"* 7 i TRIA <http://www.7itria.cat>\n"
"* Avanzosc <http://www.avanzosc.com>\n"
"* Markus Schneider <markus.schneider@initos.com>\n"
"* `Tecnativa <https://www.tecnativa.com>`_:\n"
"\n"
