"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"Extends Account Financial Risk to manage payments returns.\n"
"\n"
"If any limit is exceed the partner gets forbidden to confirm sale orders.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Go to *Customers > Financial Risk*\n"
"#. Set limits and choose options to compute in credit limit.\n"
"#. Create an invoice and pay it.\n"
"#. Create a payment return.\n"
"#. Go to *Invoicing/Accounting > Customers > Invoices* and create new\n"
"   customer invoices.\n"
"#. Test the restriction trying to create an invoice for the partner for an\n"
"   amount higher of the limit you have set.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/credit-control/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
