"* Acysos S.L.\n"
"* Tecnativa\n"
"* ACSONE SA/NV\n"
"* GRAP\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"* OpenERP S.A.\n"
"* Ignacio Ibeas <ignacio@acysos.com>\n"
"* Pedro M. Baeza <pedro.baeza@tecnativa.com>\n"
"* Jonathan Nemry <jonathan.nemry@acsone.eu>\n"
"* Sylvain LE GAL (https://twitter.com/legalsylvain)\n"
