"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"* Adrien Peiffer <adrien.peiffer@acsone.eu>\n"
"* Sébastien Alix <sebastien.alix@osiell.com>\n"
"* Stéphane Bidoul <stephane.bidoul@acsone.eu>\n"
"* Enric Tobella <etobella@creublanca.es>\n"
"* Graeme Gellatly <gdgellatly@gmail.com>\n"
