"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"[ADD] Demo data and feature to set analytic account for products.\n"
"\n"
"10.0.1.0.0 (2017-06-13)\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"Migrated to odoo 10.\n"
"\n"
