"groups:\n"
"\n"
"- 'User'\n"
"- 'Full Access'.\n"
"\n"
"The user group 'Equipment Manager', already provided by the standard Odoo,\n"
"will also be listed in the group category 'Maintenance'.\n"
"\n"
