"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"On the form view of a Partner, in the *Sales & Purchase* tab, there are 2 fields:\n"
"\n"
"* Customer Invoice Transmission Method\n"
"* Vendor Invoice Reception Method\n"
"\n"
