"  * Validate the order (only if paid, always, never)\n"
"  * Send order confirmation mail (only when order confirmed)\n"
"  * Create an invoice\n"
"  * Validate the invoice\n"
"  * Send the invoice via e-mail\n"
"  * Confirm the picking\n"
"\n"
