"\n"
"* `Trobz <https://trobz.com>`_:\n"
"\n"
"    * Nguyễn Minh Chiến <chien@trobz.com>\n"
"\n"
"* `Moduon <https://www.moduon.team>`_:\n"
"\n"
"    * Jairo Llopis\n"
"\n"
"Other credits\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"The migration of this module from 15.0 to 16.0 was financially supported by Camptocamp\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
