"    :target: https://github.com/OCA/timesheet/tree/16.0/project_task_analytic_propagation\n"
"    :alt: OCA/timesheet\n"
".. |badge4| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/weblate-Translate%20me-F47D42.png\n"
