"\n"
"This module adds the concept of type applied to fiscal positions and partners. The idea is to categorize them for not applying fiscal positions that doesn't belong to the same type.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
